## An overloaded `drop` (the resolver renames the variants to
## `drop__overload<N>`). A `drop` variant with no explicit return type must
## still default to Unit — not trip the "public function must have an explicit
## return type" check, which matched the bare name `drop` only.
class Res
  count: Int

  def drop
    nil
  end

  def drop(n: Int)
    nil
  end
end
